{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "41ce64ac-e812-8f3c-90c6-d82617ba6787",
  "created_at": "2026-03-09T11:35:27-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Stephen Chase",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:31:46-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:31:51-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good morning. Stephen Chase, 330 Ayrault Street, up on the Hill. I've got water standing in my yard again and it's coming from that storm drain out front."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:32:03-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Chase, 330 Ayrault Street. Is that water in the street or in your yard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:32:10-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both. The drain backs up and it spills over onto the lawn. [pause] Sorry, I'm having my cereal, it's nearly noon and I haven't eaten. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:32:21-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. Is any of it getting into the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:32:27-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no. Never had a drop inside. Not in the house, not in the cellar. But the yard, that's twice now this winter. It was the rain Friday into Saturday, two days ago, and it's still sitting there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:32:42-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the yard flooded twice this winter, nothing inside, and the most recent was the rain over the weekend. Do I have that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:32:52-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. And it was Friday night into Saturday, not Saturday into Sunday. I like to get that straight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:33:00-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Friday into Saturday. I'll write it that way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:33:05-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Now here's what's bothering me. The water's running down the slope toward my neighbor's garage. [pause] It's not in there yet, but it's heading that way, and if we get more rain it will be."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:33:19-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Which side is the neighbor, left or right as you face the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:33:25-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The right side, the downhill side. I'm not going to give you the name, they're nice people. Just the garage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:33:33-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I'll note it as the neighboring garage on the downhill side, water heading that direction from the drain in front of 330."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:33:43-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. And I'd like somebody to actually come look at it. Last time I was told they'd take care of it and nobody came that I saw."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:33:54-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry about that. I'll put in a request for a crew to check the drain and clear it if it's blocked. Can I confirm the best number for you, 401-555-0185?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:34:06-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. That's the house line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:34:09-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. And is there anything else on it, like leaves or debris over the grate?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:34:15-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Leaves, some. I raked around it myself in the fall. But it's not just leaves, it's backed up underneath. I've lived here a long time, I know the difference."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:34:26-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put that in, that you think it's blocked below the grate and not just on top."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:34:33-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do the crews work weekends? Because if it rains again Saturday I don't want to wait until Monday for somebody."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:34:41-04:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After a big storm they're usually out when they can be, but the regular crews are weekdays. For an emergency there's a way to flag it, but for now I'll mark this one as a priority since water is heading toward a garage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:34:58-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'd appreciate that. It's been going on long enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:35:03-04:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. So I have 330 Ayrault Street, drain out front backing up, yard flooded twice this winter, no water inside, and water running toward the neighbor's garage. Someone will be out as soon as the crew can get to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:35:19-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's correct. All right, thank you, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:35:22-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Chase. Enjoy your breakfast."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:35:25-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Brunch, now. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
